    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the rebuilding part is what's hard. it's not just about being sad, it's the math of it. i'm way too old to start over from scratch. i spent two decades building this one thing and now it's zero. it's like i played a whole game and when it was over, i realized i didn't actually win anything. i'm just tired of the effort for no reward.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
