      "content": "I hear how incredibly devastating the mathematical reality of your loss feels, and I validate that the fear of being too old to start over is completely understandable right now. The sense that your decades of effort have vanished into nothingness is an incredibly lonely and overwhelming perspective. While the math looks bleak, your resilience in facing this crisis shows you are already beginning the hard work of rebuilding, even if the path isn't visible yet.",
      "source": "target",
