      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes complete sense to feel like something is rigged when the effort seems to consistently result in loss, leading to a devastating sense of hopelessness. That powerful \"stop losing\" instinct is a natural urge to protect yourself from further pain when the original system feels broken. Please remember that it is okay to step away from a situation that no longer serves you, especially if the immediate priority is allowing yourself to heal rather than force a return to work.",
